      "body": "Excellent! Now I have a comprehensive view of the data. Let me create a plan for mapping these ICD codes to diagnosis names and DSM-5 TR equivalents.",
      "time": 1780168269.728436,
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::CopilotAcpPersona",
