Parse and normalize the ICD codes from the three diagnosis columns\n+4. Merge reference data with patient records\n+5. Generate summary statistics and preliminary associations\n+6. Export analysis-ready dataset\n+\n",
              "fileName": "/Users/matthewgold/.copilot/session-state/b2b3476e-5c60-40ee-bba7-6e719d7ee678/plan.md"
            }
          }
        ]
