sorder, single episode, unspecified                  Depressive Disorders                   733\n      F41.1                                            Generalized anxiety disorder                     Anxiety Disorders                   718\n     R46.89                                                R46.89 [Requires lookup]                                   NaN                   706\n     F34.81                                  Disruptive mood dysregulation disorder                  Depressive Disorders                   637\n        F39                                               Unspecified mood disorder                  Depressive Disorders                   455\n      F91.3                                  Adolescent-onset type conduct disorder                      Conduct Disorder                   444\n    R45.850                                                      Homicidal ideation                 Other Mental Disorder                   384\n      F43.9                       Unspecified trauma- and stressor-related disorder Trauma and Stressor-Related Disorders                   345\n      F33.2 Major depressive disorder, recurrent, severe without psychotic features                  Depressive Disorders                   265\n\nTOP DSM-5 DIAGNOSTIC CATEGORIES\n================================\nBy Prevalence (Unique Patients):\n                                       Unique_Patients  Total_Occurrences\ndsm5_category                                                            \nDepressive Disorders                              1779               3182\nTrauma and Stressor-Related Disorders             1424               2572\nADHD                                              1399               2333\nNon-Suicidal Self-Injury Behavior                 1348               2985\nAnxiety Disorders                                 1154               1980\nAutism Spectrum Disorder                           513                794\nConduct Disorder                        