status',\n    'Z91.010': 'Food allergy status, initial encounter',\n    'Z91.120': 'Latex allergy status',\n    'Z91.14': 'Radiographic dye allergy',\n}\n\nprint(f\"Added {len(icd10_descriptions)} code descriptions\")\nEOFPY\n"
