            "raw_output": {
              "detailedContent": "{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"text\":{\"value\":\"The official mapping between ICD-10-CM codes and DSM-5-TR diagnoses is provided by the American Psychiatric Association (APA) and is included directly in the DSM-5-TR manual and its approved updates. The DSM-5-TR adopts ICD-10-CM codes for all official diagnoses, and the code listings in the DSM-5-TR reflect the most up-to-date mappings as released by the National Center for Health Statistics (NCHS) and endorsed by APA\u30103:2\u2020source\u3011\u30103:8\u2020source\u3011.\\n\\n**Where to find the official mapping for 2024:**\\n- The APA releases annual DSM-5-TR update supplements with any changes to diagnostic criteria, text, and most importantly, ICD-10-CM codes. You can always access the most current official updates (including the September 2024 edition, which is the reference point for billing/discharge coding from October 1, 2024 onward) on the APA\u2019s official site: [APA DSM-5-TR Updates](https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm-criteria-text)\u30103:0\u2020source\u3011.\\n- The DSM-5-TR manual itself contains both the DSM-5-TR text and the corresponding ICD-10-CM codes for each mental disorder at the end of each diagnosis entry. The Desk Reference version includes only the criteria, specifiers, and codes.\\n\\n**Key details:**\\n- All DSM-5-TR disorders are assigned an ICD-10-CM code (the alphanumeric code following the diagnosis name), which is the exact code to use for billing/reporting.\\n- The codes listed are compliant with HIPAA and reflect all approved updates as of the publication date and any subsequent supplements (such as September 2024).\\n- Changes or new codes are typically implemented each October 1 for the new fiscal year in the US, corresponding to the CMS/NCHS annual updates.\\n\\n**For practical purposes:**\\n- If you want the latest September 2024 DSM-5-TR Update Supplement, you can download the PDF directly from the APA: [DSM-5-TR Update September 2024 PDF](https://www.psychiatry.org/File%20Library/Psychiatrists/Practice/DSM/APA_DSM5TR-September-2024-Update.pdf)\u30103:0\u2020source\u3011.\\n- For ICD-10-CM itself, including browsing or searching codes, use the CDC/NCHS tool: [ICD-10-CM Browser Tool](https://icd10cmtool.cdc.gov/)\u30103:7\u2020source\u3011.\\n\\n**Reference:**\\n- American Psychiatric Association. (2022). Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (5th ed., text rev.; DSM-5-TR). American Psychiatric Association. [Updates](https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm-criteria-text)\u30103:3\u2020source\u3011\u30103:0\u2020source\u3011.\\n\\nIf you need a specific code for a specific disorder, let me know! I can give you the official ICD-10-CM code as per DSM-5-TR for 2024.\",\"annotations\":[{\"text\":\"\",\"start_index\":422,\"end_index\":434,\"url_citation\":{\"title\":\"APA - DSM - Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders\",\"url\":\"https://www.appi.org/dsm\"}},{\"text\":\"\",\"start_index\":434,\"end_index\":446,\"url_citation\":{\"title\":\"DSM-5-TR Overview | NBCC\",\"url\":\"https://www.nbcc.org/exams/dsm\"}},{\"text\":\"\",\"start_index\":954,\"end_index\":966,\"url_citation\":{\"title\":\"Updates to DSM-5-TR Criteria and Text - Psychiatry.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm/updates-to-dsm-5-tr-criteria-text\"}},{\"text\":\"\",\"start_index\":1982,\"end_index\":1994,\"url_citation\":{\"title\":\"Updates to DSM-5-TR Criteria and Text - Psychiatry.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm/updates-to-dsm-5-tr-criteria-text\"}},{\"text\":\"\",\"start_index\":2136,\"end_index\":2148,\"url_citation\":{\"title\":\"ICD-10-CM | Classification of Diseases, Functioning, and Disability | CDC\",\"url\":\"https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/icd/icd-10-cm/index.html\"}},{\"text\":\"\",\"start_index\":2423,\"end_index\":2435,\"url_citation\":{\"title\":\"Diagnostic Manual References - APA Style\",\"url\":\"https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines/references/examples/diagnostic-manual-references\"}},{\"text\":\"\",\"start_index\":2435,\"end_index\":2447,\"url_citation\":{\"title\":\"Updates to DSM-5-TR Criteria and Text - Psychiatry.org\",\"url\":\"https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm/updates-to-dsm-5-tr-criteria-text\"}}]},\"bing_searches\":[{\"text\":\"ICD-10-CM to DSM-5-TR mapping official reference 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.bing.com/search?q=ICD-10-CM+to+DSM-5-TR+mapping+official+reference+2024\"}],\"annotations\":null}",
              "contents": [
                {
                  "text": "{\n  \"type\": \"output_text\",\n  \"text\": {\n    \"value\": \"The official mapping between ICD-10-CM codes and DSM-5-TR diagnoses is provided by the American Psychiatric Association (APA) and is included directly in the DSM-5-TR manual and its approved updates. The DSM-5-TR adopts ICD-10-CM codes for all official diagnoses, and the code listings in the DSM-5-TR reflect the most up-to-date mappings as released by the National Center for Health Statistics (NCHS) and endorsed by APA\u30103:2\u2020source\u3011\u30103:8\u2020source\u3011.\\n\\n**Where to find the official mapping for 2024:**\\n- The APA releases annual DSM-5-TR update supplements with any changes to diagnostic criteria, text, and most importantly, ICD-10-CM codes. You can always access the most current official updates (including the September 2024 edition, which is the reference point for billing/discharge coding from October 1, 2024 onward) on the APA\u2019s official site: [APA DSM-5-TR Updates](https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm-criteria-text)\u30103:0\u2020source\u3011.\\n- The DSM-5-TR manual itself contains both the DSM-5-TR text and the corresponding ICD-10-CM codes for each mental disorder at the end of each diagnosis entry. The Desk Reference version includes only the criteria, specifiers, and codes.\\n\\n**Key details:**\\n- All DSM-5-TR disorders are assigned an ICD-10-CM code (the alphanumeric code following the diagnosis name), which is the exact code to use for billing/reporting.\\n- The codes listed are compliant with HIPAA and reflect all approved updates as of the publication date and any subsequent supplements (such as September 2024).\\n- Changes or new codes are typically implemented each October 1 for the new fiscal year in the US, corresponding to the CMS/NCHS annual updates.\\n\\n**For practical purposes:**\\n- If you want the latest September 2024 DSM-5-TR Update Supplement, you can download the PDF directly from the APA: [DSM-5-TR Update September 2024 PDF](https://www.psychiatry.org/File%20Library/Psychiatrists/Practice/DSM/APA_DSM5TR-September-2024-Update.pdf)\u30103:0\u2020source\u3011.\\n- For ICD-10-CM itself, including browsing or searching codes, use the CDC/NCHS tool: [ICD-10-CM Browser Tool](https://icd10cmtool.cdc.gov/)\u30103:7\u2020source\u3011.\\n\\n**Reference:**\\n- American Psychiatric Association. (2022). Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (5th ed., text rev.; DSM-5-TR). American Psychiatric Association. [Updates](https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm-criteria-text)\u30103:3\u2020source\u3011\u30103:0\u2020source\u3011.\\n\\nIf you need a specific code for a specific disorder, let me know! I can give you the official ICD-10-CM code as per DSM-5-TR for 2024.\",\n    \"annotations\": [\n      {\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        \"start_index\": 422,\n        \"end_index\": 434,\n        \"url_citation\": {\n          \"title\": \"APA - DSM - Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.appi.org/dsm\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        \"start_index\": 434,\n        \"end_index\": 446,\n        \"url_citation\": {\n          \"title\": \"DSM-5-TR Overview | NBCC\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.nbcc.org/exams/dsm\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        \"start_index\": 954,\n        \"end_index\": 966,\n        \"url_citation\": {\n          \"title\": \"Updates to DSM-5-TR Criteria and Text - Psychiatry.org\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm/updates-to-dsm-5-tr-criteria-text\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        \"start_index\": 1982,\n        \"end_index\": 1994,\n        \"url_citation\": {\n          \"title\": \"Updates to DSM-5-TR Criteria and Text - Psychiatry.org\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm/updates-to-dsm-5-tr-criteria-text\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        \"start_index\": 2136,\n        \"end_index\": 2148,\n        \"url_citation\": {\n          \"title\": \"ICD-10-CM | Classification of Diseases, Functioning, and Disability | CDC\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/icd/icd-10-cm/index.html\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        \"start_index\": 2423,\n        \"end_index\": 2435,\n        \"url_citation\": {\n          \"title\": \"Diagnostic Manual References - APA Style\",\n          \"url\": \"https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines/references/examples/diagnostic-manual-references\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"\",\n        \"start_index\": 2435,\n        \"end_index\": 2447,\n        \"url_citation\": {\n          \"title\": \"Updates to DSM-5-TR Criteria and Text - Psychiatry.org\",\n          \"url\": \"https://www.psychiatry.org/psychiatrists/practice/dsm/updates-to-dsm/updates-to-dsm-5-tr-criteria-text\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"bing_searches\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"ICD-10-CM to DSM-5-TR mapping official reference 2024\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.bing.com/search?q=ICD-10-CM+to+DSM-5-TR+mapping+official+reference+2024\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"annotations\": null\n}",
