      "body": "The notebook is running \u2014 the 10s timeout just means it's still going (expected, given the ML cross-validation). Watch the cells execute in JupyterLab. The ML section (cells 10\u201312) will take the longest \u2014 a couple of minutes for the 10-fold CV across all three models.\n\nOnce you see the final summary cell print the AUC scores, everything is done. Let me know what comes out and we can fix anything that errors or tune any figure.",
