    {
      "body": "That's just a harmless warning \u2014 it won't stop the analysis. `tqdm` (used by SHAP internally) wants `ipywidgets` to render progress bars as interactive widgets inside the notebook. Without it, it falls back to plain text output. Everything still runs fine.\n\nIf you want to suppress it cleanly, just install `ipywidgets` into `.venv`:\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/pip install ipywidgets\n```\n\nBut it's cosmetic \u2014 if the cells are executing and you're seeing outputs/figures, the analysis is working correctly. Are subsequent cells running okay?",
