      "id": "062ef1c4-74a2-4d48-a1f5-1dbac777460a",
      "body": "I have added the visualizations for all requested descriptive statistics. The notebook now includes a comprehensive **Cohort Overview Dashboard** (inserted right after the data loading section) which features:\n\n1.  **Readmission Count Distribution**: A bar chart showing the frequency of 0, 1, 2, and 3+ readmissions, labeled with the mean and standard deviation.\n2.  **ACE Score Distribution & Completeness**: A histogram of ACE scores with a KDE overlay, including the median and a note on the data collection rate (59.2%).\n3.  **Length of Stay (LOS)**: A distribution plot of stay durations with mean and median markers.\n4.  **Diagnostic Burden (Visit vs. Chronic)**: Side-by-side boxplots comparing the number of visit diagnoses vs. chronic diagnoses.\n5.  **Medical Comorbidity Breakdown**: A horizontal bar chart showing the prevalence (%) of major medical types (Metabolic/Obesity, Sleep, GI/Digestive, Respiratory/Allergy, and Renal/Urologic).\n6.  **Readmission Prevalence**: A donut/pie chart summarizing the overall 9.3% readmission rate.\n\nI have also ensured that all significance markers are updated to specific p-values ($p < 0.05$), fixed the clipping in the complexity quartile chart, and applied the $p < 0.001$ `***` marker for physical restraints. The `KeyError: 'csrss_red'` has been fully resolved.\n\nThe notebook is complete and ready for execution.",
      "raw_time": false,
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::GeminiAcpPersona",
      "mentions": []
