      "body": "@Claude  That's simply incorrect. Still in the random forest SHAP dependence plots and still in the unmodified catboost SHAP dependence plots there are negative x values all the way out to almost -2. Additionally, the FAMD component loadings chart needs a label for each PC. There also needs to be a positive value on the y axis for the decision curve analysis graph for orientation.",
      "raw_time": false,
      "id": "816c7a1d-dd98-4543-8bb9-1df13376673c",
