      "body": "The shared comorbidity classifier is now in the feature-engineering cell. I\u2019m updating the table and cohort-summary cells to reuse it and fix the percentage denominator.",
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::CodexAcpPersona",
