breakdown.empty:\n    print(\"  No mapped medical comorbidity categories found.\")\nelse:\n    display_breakdown = med_breakdown.copy()\n    display_breakdown['Patient %'] = display_breakdown['pct_of_patients'].map(lambda x: f'{x:.1f}%')\n    display_breakdown['Mention %'] = display_breakdown['pct_of_mentions'].map(lambda x: f'{x:.1f}%')\n    print(display_breakdown[['type', 'n', 'Patient %', 'Mention %']].to_string(index=False))\n\n    fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 7))\n    labels = [f\"{row.type}\\n(n={int(row.n)})\" for row in med_breakdown.itertuples()]\n    colors_med = sns.color_palette('Set2', n_colors=len(med_breakdown))\n    ax.pie(\n        med_breakdown['n'],\n        labels=labels,\n        autopct='%1.1f%%',\n        startangle=90,\n        counterclock=False,\n        colors=colors_med,\n        textprops={'fontsize': 10},\n        wedgeprops={'edgecolor': 'white', 'linewidth': 1},\n    )\n    ax.set_title('Medical Comorbidity Breakdown\\n(share of mapped code-type mentions)',\n                 fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\n    plt.tight_layout()\n    plt.savefig('figures/Fig_medical_comorbidity_breakdown.png')\n    plt.show()\n    print(\"\\n\u2713 Medical comorbidity breakdown saved\")```\n\n#### Output\n\n```\nOverall Readmission Stats (Continuous):\n  Mean # Readmissions: 0.10 \u00b1 0.34\n  Readmitted (%):      9.3%\n\nACE Score Stats:\n  Mean:   3.7 \u00b1 2.6\n  Median: 3.0\n  N collected: 1569 (59.2%)\n\nLength of Stay (LOS):\n  Mean:   10.0 \u00b1 6.9\n  Median: 8.0\n\nDiagnostic Burdens (Mean \u00b1 SD, Median):\n  Visit                4.3 \u00b1 2.3 | Mdn: 4.0\n  Chronic              5.3 \u00b1 5.4 | Mdn: 4.0\n  Non-Suicidal (NSSI)  0.4 \u00b1 0.5 | Mdn: 0.0\n\nMedical Comorbidity Breakdown (Top Types; categories may overlap by patient):\n               type   n Patient % Mention %\n       GI/Digestive 240      9.0%     27.5%\n  Metabolic/Obesity 217      8.2%     24.8%\n     Sleep Disorder 180      6.8%     20.6%\nRespiratory/Allergy 135      5.1%     15.4%\n     Renal/Urologic 102      3.8%     11.7%\n```\n\n```\n<Figure size 1200x1050 with 1 Axes>```\n\n```\n\n\u2713 Medical comorbidity breakdown saved\n```"
